      "title": "Caller attribution & signing",
      "items": [
        "L1 forwards X-Caller-Authorization; L2 re-verifies it and selects the user's wallet or platform account",
        "Person runs check GET /v1/budget before starting; not onboarded or disabled stops with 409 before model calls",
        "Every ledger write updates the keyed chain and external head anchor before returning paymentHeaders"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "On-chain truth & budget release",
      "items": [
        "L3 never trusts PAYMENT-RESPONSE alone; CONFIRMED requires a matching ERC-20 Transfer log and finality",
        "Unsettled claims stay PENDING until validBefore + 60 s and release budget only if EIP-3009 nonce is unused",
        "RPC endpoint keys are stripped to origin-only before entering L3 logs or L2 ledger details (SEC-54)"
      ]
    }
